  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dSQv/156",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">개인적인 생각입니다만,&#160;키트를 구입하여 활동하는 것을 좋아하지 않는 편입니다. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">재생종이 만들기는 5인용으로 판매하는 키트를 구입하여 수업에 활용하였습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">재생종이의 의의를 설명하고 바로 만들기에 들어갔습니다. 방법은 간단하지만 시간은 제법 걸립니다. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">종이죽 재료를 조금씩 뜯어내어 물을 넣어 반죽하고, 틀에 부은 다음 그늘에서 잘 말리면 됩니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">반죽할 때 재료와 물과의 비율은 종이죽: 물 = 1:2이지만 저마다 조금씩 다르게 해보라고 안내하였습니다. 반죽을 얇게 펴면 이틀 후면 마른다는데&#160;우리는 두껍게 하여 좀 더 걸렸습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오늘은&#160;완성된 재생종이 위에 저마다 흔적&#160;하나씩을 남기고 바로 EM 만들기에 들어갔습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99933A4F5CBD7F6B26\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99933A4F5CBD7F6B26\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999DC4495CBD7F7F0A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999DC4495CBD7F7F0A\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9916F74A5CBD7F8E2A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9916F74A5CBD7F8E2A\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5cef0c20f1180e78a32ec5d13bdf928e050f1ffc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5cef0c20f1180e78a32ec5d13bdf928e050f1ffc\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992E9E485CBD7FB529\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992E9E485CBD7FB529\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e0af1a6bd0fc7fa7c630149d1b5eeea21454352\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e0af1a6bd0fc7fa7c630149d1b5eeea21454352\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160; </span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
